{
  "info": {
    "name": "RHCL Demo — travel-agency, planos, pacotes e CDC",
    "description": "Testes das APIs da demo do Red Hat Connectivity Link, por ato.\n\nSETUP: gere o environment com as chaves reais do cluster:\n    bash scripts/postman-env.sh\ne importe postman/rhcl-demo.local.postman_environment.json.\n\nA chave vai por query (?APIKEY=...), como as policies esperam. O corte de\nrate limit tem DOIS caminhos: o request 'estourar o free' prova o 429 numa\nexecucao so (pre-request queima a cota), e o Runner com 14 iteracoes na\npasta Ato 2 mostra o corte requisicao a requisicao.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Ato 1 — a borda e fechada",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "travels SEM chave -> 401",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://api-travels.{{apps_domain}}/travels/Roma",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": [
                "api-travels",
                "{{apps_domain}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "travels",
                "Roma"
              ],
              "query": []
            },
            "description": ""
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('sem chave e 401 (deny-all na borda)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"
                ]
